# Clean Architecture

Every app in this repo (Rust API, Angular portal, Android) uses the same layers:

- domain: entities + ports (interfaces). No frameworks, HTTP, SQL, or UI.
- application: use cases that depend only on domain ports.
- infrastructure / data: implementations of those ports.
- presentation: HTTP handlers, Angular/PrimeNG components, Compose. Call use-case interfaces only.

Rules:

- Communicate across layers **only through interfaces** (Rust traits, TypeScript `interface` + `InjectionToken`, Kotlin `interface`).
- Inner layers must not import outer layers.
- Wire concrete types only in composition roots: `apps/api/crates/presentation/src/main.rs`, `apps/web/src/app/app.config.ts`, Android Hilt modules.
- Presentation must not inject `HttpClient`, sqlx, MinIO, Retrofit, or Room.
- PrimeNG stays in Angular presentation. Domain/application must not import `primeng/*`.
